  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds the first native C++ portable Canvas lane with BGRA8 premultiplied render targets, direct byte and intrinsic-SIMD Color bitmap uploads, same-device GPU bitmap copies, DPI conversion, transforms, solid primitives, default text, same-device bitmap drawing with opacity and typed GPU leases, retained command lists, path/group/transform/boolean geometry, cached typed solid/linear/radial brushes and stroke styles, exact rectangle/geometry layer clips, target-preserving drawing sessions, diagnostics, and bounded D3D12/Metal/Vulkan validation.",
